{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$f''$ is the *second derivative* of $f$. In other words, it's the derivative of $f'$, which is the derivative of $f$.\n\nBecause of this, we need to differentiate $f$ twice in order to find $f''(x)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's start by finding $f'(x)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\nf'(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[2\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\n\\end{align}$\n\n[[☃ explanation 1]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"$\\begin{align}\nf'(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[2\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(-\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\right)\\cdot\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-2\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{2}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\n\\end{align}$","hidePrompt":"Got it, thanks!","showPrompt":"Show entire calculation.","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}},{"content":"Now we can differentiate $f'$ to find $f''(x)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\nf''(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[-\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\n\\end{align}$\n\n[[☃ explanation 1]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"$\\begin{align}\nf''(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[-\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\left(\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\right)\\cdot\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{2}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\n\\end{align}$","hidePrompt":"Got it, thanks!","showPrompt":"Show entire calculation.","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}},{"content":"In conclusion, $f''(x)=-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Let $f(x)=2\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)$.\n\n**Find $f''(x)$.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)$","correct":true},{"content":"$-8\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)$","correct":false},{"content":"$-\\sin\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"$-\\cos\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"onePerLine":false,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
